        "text": "Page: Forever and Ever, Amen. Sentence: \"Forever and Ever, Amen\" is a song written by Paul Overstreet and Don Schlitz, and recorded by American country music artist Randy Travis.\nPage: Forever and Ever, Amen. Sentence: It was released in March 1987 as the first single from the album \"Always & Forever\" and became Travis's third No. 1 single on the U.S. \"Billboard\" Hot Country Singles charts.\nPage: Paul Overstreet. Sentence: He has also written singles for several other country acts, including No. 1 hits for Randy Travis, Blake Shelton, and Keith Whitley, as well as hits for The Judds and Kenny Chesney.\nPage: When You Say Nothing at All. Sentence: \"When You Say Nothing at All\" is a country song written by Paul Overstreet and Don Schlitz.",
